    "app.virtual-intel-mac-needs-to-run-natively-on-this-apple" : {
      "comment" : "AppDelegate.m: Virtual Intel Mac needs to run natively on this Apple silicon Mac. Quit the app, select it in Finder, and choose File → Get Info. Turn off “Open using Rosetta”, then open the app again.",
